e Tree [World 2 + 100K!]","desc":"GO PLAY https://www.roblox.com/games/136777090671099/ORANGES-The-Fling-Tree-Reborn\n\nWelcome to Enyara's JJT Fling Upgrade Tree!\nyeah\nYou can earn Cash by dropping down the big hole near spawn. This Cash can be used to buy Upgrades, which do anything from increasing the cash you earn, the distance you fling and even unlocking new areas!\nIf you enjoy this game, please consider liking this game to show your support, it really means the world to me and I'm so grateful to have gotten this much attention. :-)\n\n--- !!!\nSorry that the game has been getting set on Private a lot, we've been running into a lot of bugs and important decisions. I hope you can learn to understand the stress we go through.\n--- !!!\n\ntags (ignore this):\ntree, upgrade tree, upgrade, difficulty fling, difficulty chart, difficulty, jjt, fling, incremental, potato, enyara, tractor, 78 nuclear missiles, the name 'Emily', 38, shopping list\n ","path":"/game/95857213610437-enyara-s-jjt-fling-upgrade-tree","slug":"95857213610437-enyara-s-jjt-fling-upgrade-tree","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/092caf473bf89ec7f622f8a4806e0f67bcad657cc6b603435f492e2d6579c1dc.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ac4da1a6ca764f5e4c7ac60b3ec08d47/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":1498653,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-15T14:40:11.020Z","creator":{"name":"sandermonkey","type":"User"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":93707779198874,"name":"+1 Speed Keyboard Escape ASMR","desc":"Welcome to [⚡] Keyboard ASMR Speed Escape! \n\n🎧Gain speed with every step going creamy click!\n🔥Unlock powerful multipliers and enjoy the ASMR sound of clicky keys.\n👥Race with friends \n🌍Become the FASTEST on the server \n🚀But be careful… one mistype and you’ll be back at the start\n\n🎧 Built for ASMR: soft sounds, smooth physics, satisfying clicks\n","path":"/game/93707779198874-1-speed-keyboard-escape-asmr","slug":"93707779